    "text": "A group G is saturated with groups from a class X if every finite subgroup\nK ⩽ G is contained in a subgroup L ⩽ G isomorphic to some group from X. Is it\ntrue that a periodic group saturated with finite simple groups of Lie type of uniformly\nbounded ranks is itself a simple group of Lie type of finite rank?       A. K. Shlëpkin",
